1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,307
这是一个在你笔记本上跑着的翻译页面
Here is a translation page running on your laptop.

2
00:00:03,627 --> 00:00:07,418
输入 good afternoon everyone，选法语，再点 Translate
Type good afternoon everyone, choose French, press Translate,

3
00:00:07,418 --> 00:00:09,344
它就回答：Bonjour à tous
and it answers: Bonjour à tous.

4
00:00:09,583 --> 00:00:11,567
现在把地址发给一个同学
Now send the address to a classmate.

5
00:00:11,887 --> 00:00:15,289
在同学的笔记本上，localhost 8086 什么也找不到
On their laptop, localhost 8086 finds nothing,

6
00:00:15,289 --> 00:00:20,613
因为 localhost 永远指这台机器，而他那台上什么都没跑
because localhost always means this machine, and nothing runs on theirs.

7
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:24,221
第 1 讲给过一个办法：租一台虚拟机
Lecture 1 gave one fix: rent a virtual machine.

8
00:00:24,541 --> 00:00:26,381
页面有了公网地址
The page gets a public address,

9
00:00:26,381 --> 00:00:30,535
可机器整晚都在计费，而根本没人在翻译
but the machine is billed all night, while nobody translates anything.

10
00:00:30,783 --> 00:00:32,532
所以今天的问题是这个
So here is today's question.

11
00:00:32,852 --> 00:00:37,909
这个页面能不能有一个公网 URL，没人用的时候又一分钱不花？
Can this page have a public URL, and cost nothing while nobody is using it?

12
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:40,091
这就是 serverless 的承诺
That is the promise of serverless.

13
00:00:40,411 --> 00:00:45,467
你应用的一个副本在请求来时出现，在流量停下时消失
A copy of your app appears when a request arrives and disappears when the traffic stops.

14
00:00:45,787 --> 00:00:49,137
到最后，同一个 image 还会作为一个 job 来跑
By the end, the same image also runs as a job.

15
00:00:49,457 --> 00:00:52,101
它从一个私有 bucket 里取一段文字
It takes a passage from a private bucket,

16
00:00:52,101 --> 00:00:55,131
用法语读出来，保存文件，然后退出
speaks it in French, saves its files and exits.

17
00:00:57,167 --> 00:01:00,702
要跟着做，先准备好你的 clone、Docker、gcloud 命令行工具
To follow along, have your clone, Docker, the gcloud tool

18
00:01:00,702 --> 00:01:03,183
还有你自己开通了结算的项目
and your own project with billing ready.

19
00:01:03,417 --> 00:01:06,251
角落里的进度条标出 README 的哪一步
A tracker in the corner names the README step,

20
00:01:06,251 --> 00:01:09,454
黄色的 your turn 标签表示暂停一下，自己跑一遍
and a yellow tag, your turn, means pause and run it.

21
00:01:09,774 --> 00:01:12,073
先照着控制台的步骤做
Follow the console steps first;

22
00:01:12,073 --> 00:01:15,854
gcloud 命令框是替代做法，不是额外的步骤
the gcloud boxes are alternatives, not extra steps.

23
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,416
先看这一讲的位置
First, where this lecture sits:

24
00:01:19,416 --> 00:01:24,227
在课程项目的原型阶段里，部署就从这里开始
inside the prototype phase of the course project, where deployment begins.

25
00:01:24,467 --> 00:01:26,942
Cheese App 的四个部分，已经做完三个
Of the Cheese App's four parts, three are done.

26
00:01:27,262 --> 00:01:28,577
还剩模型部署
Model deploy is left, and milestone 3 asks you to deploy your model or API with Cloud Functions or Cloud Run.

27
00:01:28,577 --> 00:01:33,367
里程碑 3 要求你用 Cloud Functions 或 Cloud Run
Model deploy is left, and milestone 3 asks you to deploy your model or API with Cloud Functions or Cloud Run.

28
00:01:33,367 --> 00:01:35,283
部署你的模型或 API
Model deploy is left, and milestone 3 asks you to deploy your model or API with Cloud Functions or Cloud Run.

29
00:01:35,517 --> 00:01:38,971
课上讲的 serverless：代码只在需要时运行
The lecture's serverless: code runs only when needed,

30
00:01:38,971 --> 00:01:43,794
不用搭服务器，昂贵的硬件只给需要它的那一步
no servers to set up, and costly hardware only for the step that needs it.

31
00:01:44,033 --> 00:01:47,671
上周的 Vertex AI 训练任务就是一例
Last week's Vertex AI training job was one case;

32
00:01:47,671 --> 00:01:50,020
今天讲函数和 Cloud Run
today, functions and Cloud Run;

33
00:01:50,020 --> 00:01:52,673
下周讲 endpoint 和 pipeline
next week, endpoints and pipelines.

34
00:01:52,917 --> 00:01:55,712
它的地图是一个应用，四种部署方式
Its map is one app, four ways to deploy it.

35
00:01:56,032 --> 00:01:59,771
横着看你交出的是什么，一个代码文件还是一个 container
Across, what you hand over, a code file or a container;

36
00:01:59,771 --> 00:02:03,306
竖着看它在哪儿跑，一台租来的机器还是 serverless
down, where it runs, a rented machine or serverless.

37
00:02:03,626 --> 00:02:07,509
第 1 讲和第 2 讲填了上面一行；今天填下面一行
Lectures 1 and 2 filled the top row; today fills the bottom.

38
00:02:07,750 --> 00:02:10,459
README 的四个部分都在下面这一行里
The README's four parts sit in that bottom row.

39
00:02:10,779 --> 00:02:12,678
第 1 部分交出的是一个文件
Part 1 hands over a file.

40
00:02:12,998 --> 00:02:15,358
第 2 到第 4 部分交出的是一个 image
Parts 2 to 4 hand over one image,

41
00:02:15,358 --> 00:02:18,075
先作为 web service，再作为 job
first as a web service, then as a job.

42
00:02:18,317 --> 00:02:19,960
再注意我们部署的是什么
And notice what we deploy.

43
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:23,928
部署的不是翻译模型，那是一个外部服务在跑
Not the translation model, which an outside service runs,

44
00:02:23,928 --> 00:02:26,168
而是它外面的应用代码
but the application code around it.

45
00:02:26,488 --> 00:02:28,877
你的 Cheese App 后端会扮演这个角色
Your Cheese App backend will play that role.

46
00:02:29,117 --> 00:02:30,603
两个小提示
Two small notes.

47
00:02:30,653 --> 00:02:32,153
课程页面链接到的几节
The course page links

48
00:02:32,153 --> 00:02:36,072
重写后的 README 已经没有了，所以从头开始
to sections the rewritten README no longer has, so start at the top.

49
00:02:36,392 --> 00:02:39,293
而且我们跟的是课程链接现在指向的 README
And we follow the README the course link serves now,

50
00:02:39,293 --> 00:02:41,469
不是课程地图里那个旧的 commit
not the older commit in the course map.

51
00:02:42,817 --> 00:02:44,260
开始之前
Before you begin.

52
00:02:44,310 --> 00:02:49,892
选好你的课程项目，核对它的项目 ID，不要只看显示名称
Select your course project and check its project ID, not just its display name;

53
00:02:49,892 --> 00:02:52,012
命令框里要的是 ID
the command boxes need the ID.

54
00:02:52,332 --> 00:02:56,527
确认结算已开通，而且你有权限创建这些资源
Confirm billing is on and that you may create these resources;

55
00:02:56,527 --> 00:02:58,625
如果没有，先问课程组
if not, ask course staff first.

56
00:02:58,867 --> 00:03:01,768
选一个区域：README 用的是多伦多
Choose a region: the README uses Toronto.

57
00:03:02,088 --> 00:03:04,989
后面的语音模型用 us-central1
The speech model later uses us-central1,

58
00:03:04,989 --> 00:03:07,166
这是第 3 部分里一个单独的设置
a separate setting for part 3.

59
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:10,011
工作表列出了你要建的东西
The worksheet names what you will create:

60
00:03:10,011 --> 00:03:13,896
这个函数、web service、job、两个运行时账号
the function, the web service, the job, two runtime accounts,

61
00:03:13,896 --> 00:03:16,126
还有第 4 部分里你自己起名的两个 bucket
and two buckets you name in part 4.

62
00:03:16,367 --> 00:03:18,714
第 4 步：把 repo clone 下来
Step 4: clone the repository.

63
00:03:19,034 --> 00:03:23,077
README 写的是 clone 或下载，所以我们的 git clone 是额外的
The README says clone or download, so our git clone is extra,

64
00:03:23,077 --> 00:03:26,458
显示我们所跟 commit 的 git log 也是
and so is the git log showing the commit we follow.

65
00:03:26,778 --> 00:03:28,234
暂停一下，clone 下来
Pause and clone it.

66
00:03:28,284 --> 00:03:29,486
额外列一下目录
An extra listing

67
00:03:29,486 --> 00:03:34,124
根目录下有一些旧文件，包括 main.py 和一个 Dockerfile
shows older files at the root, including main.py and a Dockerfile,

68
00:03:34,124 --> 00:03:36,118
README 从来不用它们
which the README never uses;

69
00:03:36,118 --> 00:03:37,599
别去构建
don't build them.

70
00:03:37,649 --> 00:03:39,976
今天的内容都在 tutorial 下面
Today's work sits under tutorial:

71
00:03:39,976 --> 00:03:42,726
第 1 部分用 function 目录，image 用 app 目录
function for part 1, app for the image.

72
00:03:42,984 --> 00:03:48,222
然后是终端设置，先跑 gcloud auth login，这是浏览器登录
Then the terminal setup, starting with gcloud auth login, a browser sign-in;

73
00:03:48,222 --> 00:03:51,048
额外跑一下 auth list，现在还没有账号
an extra auth list shows no accounts yet.

74
00:03:51,368 --> 00:03:54,212
它登录的是 gcloud 命令行工具，不是应用
It logs in the gcloud tool, not the app;

75
00:03:54,212 --> 00:03:56,701
应用的身份第 3 部分再说
the app's identity comes in part 3.

76
00:03:56,950 --> 00:04:01,242
接下来是七条 export：项目、区域、image、两个名字
Seven exports follow: project, region, image, two names and two account emails built from your project ID.

77
00:04:01,242 --> 00:04:04,630
还有用你的项目 ID 拼出来的两个账号邮箱
Seven exports follow: project, region, image, two names and two account emails built from your project ID.

78
00:04:04,950 --> 00:04:07,212
暂停一下，用你真实的 ID 把它们跑一遍
Pause and run them with your real ID.

79
00:04:08,650 --> 00:04:13,258
关于这次录制：这台机器没有 Google 账号，也没有项目
About this recording: this machine has no Google account and no project.

80
00:04:13,578 --> 00:04:17,220
所以每个 gcloud 命令框都跑到第一个真实报错为止
So every gcloud box runs until its first honest error,

81
00:04:17,220 --> 00:04:18,720
控制台是画出来的
the console is drawn,

82
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:22,346
云端的结果来自 README 自己的录制记录
and cloud results come from the README's own recording.

83
00:04:22,883 --> 00:04:24,483
第 1 部分：一个函数
Part 1: a function.

84
00:04:24,803 --> 00:04:29,057
课上说它是一段由事件触发的轻量代码
The lecture calls it lightweight code that an event starts,

85
00:04:29,057 --> 00:04:33,742
比如一次文件上传、一次数据库变更，或者今天的 HTTP 请求
like a file upload, a database change, or today, an HTTP request.

86
00:04:34,062 --> 00:04:36,792
它只在运行时计费，而且会自动扩缩
It is billed while it runs and scales by itself.

87
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:43,167
它的四步：打开控制台、启用 API、写一个 Python 文件、部署
Its four steps: open the console, enable the APIs, write a Python file, deploy.

88
00:04:43,487 --> 00:04:45,293
有一个名字变了：Cloud Functions
One name has changed:

89
00:04:45,293 --> 00:04:47,953
现在叫 Cloud Run functions，所以 README
Cloud Functions are now Cloud Run functions,

90
00:04:47,953 --> 00:04:52,212
从 Cloud Run、Services、Write a function 开始
so the README starts at Cloud Run, Services, Write a function.

91
00:04:52,450 --> 00:04:54,135
这会打开 Create service
That opens Create service.

92
00:04:54,455 --> 00:04:56,546
如果它提示，就启用 API
Enable the APIs if it asks.

93
00:04:56,866 --> 00:05:00,364
把 service 命名为 translate-function，再选你的区域
Name the service translate-function and choose your region.

94
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:05,848
运行时选 Python 3.12；旧版 README 写的是 3.10
For the runtime, pick Python 3.12; the older README said 3.10.

95
00:05:06,168 --> 00:05:08,004
选 Allow public access
Choose Allow public access,

96
00:05:08,004 --> 00:05:11,266
这样谁拿到 URL 都能调用它，然后点 Create
so anyone with the URL may call it, then Create.

97
00:05:11,516 --> 00:05:14,439
打开 Source editor；暂停一下，建一个你自己的
Open the Source editor; pause and create yours.

98
00:05:14,759 --> 00:05:18,476
金色标签：这个函数按 Cloud Run service 计费
A gold tag: the function bills as a Cloud Run service,

99
00:05:18,476 --> 00:05:20,540
每次部署都会跑一次构建
and every deploy runs a build.

100
00:05:20,783 --> 00:05:24,004
把 main.py 换成教程的处理函数
Replace main.py with the tutorial's handler.

101
00:05:24,324 --> 00:05:29,764
装饰器把它标成一个 HTTP 函数，名字叫 hello 下划线 http
The decorator marks an HTTP function called hello_http.

102
00:05:30,084 --> 00:05:34,970
它从请求里取 text、source 和 destination，每个都有默认值
It takes text, source and destination from the request, each with a default.

103
00:05:35,216 --> 00:05:39,077
旁边，课件上的示意代码按位置把 source 放在第二个
Beside it, the lecture's sketch passes source second, by position.

104
00:05:39,397 --> 00:05:42,779
在这个库里，第二个位置是 destination
In this library the second slot is the destination,

105
00:05:42,779 --> 00:05:45,233
所以 source 和 destination 会对调
so source and destination would swap;

106
00:05:45,233 --> 00:05:47,355
这个处理函数是按名字传的
the handler passes them by name.

107
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:50,843
把 requirements 文件换成两个精确的 pin
Replace the requirements file with two exact pins.

108
00:05:51,163 --> 00:05:55,557
新版的 googletrans 是异步的，会把这个简单的处理函数弄坏
The newer googletrans is asynchronous and would break this simple handler.

109
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:59,747
把 Function entry point 设成 hello 下划线 http
Set the Function entry point to hello_http.

110
00:06:00,067 --> 00:06:04,559
用 README 的话说，它是框架应该调用的那个 Python 函数
In the README's words, it is the Python function the framework should call,

111
00:06:04,559 --> 00:06:06,595
不是文件名，也不是 service 名称
not the file name or service name.

112
00:06:06,915 --> 00:06:10,237
点 Save and redeploy，等这个 revision
Select Save and redeploy and wait for the revision,

113
00:06:10,237 --> 00:06:14,275
也就是你的代码和设置部署出来的一个版本，变成就绪
a deployed version of your code and settings, to become ready.

114
00:06:14,595 --> 00:06:15,966
暂停一下，照着做
Pause and do it.

115
00:06:16,016 --> 00:06:19,813
所以课件上那一步，创建一个 Python 文件，是简化版
So the slide's step, create a Python file, is the short version.

116
00:06:20,133 --> 00:06:25,254
控制台要的是文件、它的依赖，还有要调用的函数名
The console wants the file, its dependencies and the name of the function to call.

117
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:28,200
是什么在运行你的函数？
What runs your function?

118
00:06:28,349 --> 00:06:31,559
课上说你不用管理服务器或 container
The lecture says you manage no servers or containers,

119
00:06:31,559 --> 00:06:33,981
这没错：你确实不用管它们
and that is true: you don't manage them.

120
00:06:34,301 --> 00:06:36,520
但 Google 照样会构建一个 container
But Google builds a container anyway.

121
00:06:36,767 --> 00:06:39,200
点 Save 会把你的三样输入交给 Cloud Build
Save sends your three inputs to Cloud Build.

122
00:06:39,519 --> 00:06:45,325
它在构建时把依赖装一次，配置好 Functions Framework
It installs the requirements once, at build time, configures the Functions Framework,

123
00:06:45,325 --> 00:06:48,330
再把一个 image 发布到 Artifact Registry
and publishes an image to Artifact Registry.

124
00:06:48,650 --> 00:06:51,359
Cloud Run 用这个 image 启动一个 revision
Cloud Run starts a revision from that image.

125
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:54,406
在每个实例里，Functions Framework
In each instance, the Functions Framework

126
00:06:54,406 --> 00:06:57,006
在 gunicorn 下跑一个小的 Flask 应用
runs a small Flask app under gunicorn,

127
00:06:57,006 --> 00:07:00,496
监听所有网络接口，用的是 Cloud Run 给的 port
on every interface, at the port Cloud Run provides.

128
00:07:00,816 --> 00:07:05,637
每来一个请求，它就按入口点的名字找到你的函数，然后调用它
On each request, it looks up your function by the entry point name and calls it.

129
00:07:05,883 --> 00:07:09,019
所以课上那个代码文件的格子里，其实装着一个 container
So the lecture's file cell has a container inside.

130
00:07:09,339 --> 00:07:12,262
也正因为这样，最后才会有一个 image 要清理
That is why there is an image to clean up at the end.

131
00:07:12,500 --> 00:07:16,745
这一层也能在你的笔记本上跑，作为额外的本地替身
This layer also runs on your laptop, as an extra local stand-in.

132
00:07:17,065 --> 00:07:20,540
同样的两个 pin 会装上 Functions Framework
The same two pins install the Functions Framework,

133
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:24,084
Flask、gunicorn 和 googletrans，和构建时一样
Flask, gunicorn and googletrans, as the build does.

134
00:07:24,333 --> 00:07:27,745
把 target 设成 hello 下划线 http 启动它
Start it with target hello_http, and it prints nothing while it serves.

135
00:07:27,745 --> 00:07:29,645
它运行期间什么都不打印
Start it with target hello_http, and it prints nothing while it serves.

136
00:07:29,965 --> 00:07:33,571
这种安静是正常的：这个框架只记录错误
That silence is normal: the framework logs only errors.

137
00:07:33,817 --> 00:07:37,764
你贴了 main.py，入口点却填了 translate
You paste main.py but type translate as the entry point.

138
00:07:38,084 --> 00:07:39,655
构建会失败吗？
Does the build fail?

139
00:07:39,705 --> 00:07:42,265
如果不会，那是什么失败了，你会在哪儿看到？
If not, what fails, and where would you see it?

140
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:53,980
装依赖没问题；它们没错
Installing the requirements works; they are fine.

141
00:07:54,300 --> 00:07:55,900
但部署失败了
But the deployment fails.

142
00:07:56,177 --> 00:07:59,420
新的 revision 启动时，框架去找这个名字
When the new revision starts, the framework looks for the name.

143
00:07:59,740 --> 00:08:03,772
main.py 文件里应该有一个叫 translate 的函数
The file main.py should contain a function named translate.

144
00:08:04,092 --> 00:08:06,609
但它找到的是 hello 下划线 http
But it found hello_http.

145
00:08:06,850 --> 00:08:10,306
在 Cloud Run 上，这要去日志里找，不在你的代码里
On Cloud Run, you find this in the logs, not in your code.

146
00:08:10,626 --> 00:08:12,994
这是三个要看的地方里的第一个
That is the first of three places to look.

147
00:08:14,033 --> 00:08:17,926
第 1 步：在 service details 里，复制顶部的 URL
Step 1: in service details, copy the URL near the top;

148
00:08:17,926 --> 00:08:20,881
构建页面不是你应用的地址
the build page is not your app's address.

149
00:08:21,116 --> 00:08:23,943
第 2 步：不带参数打开它
Step 2: open it with no arguments;

150
00:08:23,943 --> 00:08:29,927
README 的录制记录显示默认是西班牙语：Bienvenido a AC215
the README's recording shows the default in Spanish: Bienvenido a AC215.

151
00:08:30,247 --> 00:08:34,514
我们的本地替身，同一个处理函数跑在同一个框架下，结果一致
Our local stand-in, the same handler under the same framework, agrees.

152
00:08:34,983 --> 00:08:37,244
第 3 步：加上查询字符串
Step 3: append the query string.

153
00:08:37,564 --> 00:08:43,687
问号是它的开头，& 符号分隔每一对，%20 是编码后的空格
The question mark begins it, ampersands split the pairs, and %20 is an encoded space.

154
00:08:44,007 --> 00:08:48,103
每一对填进处理函数的一行，那一行的默认值就让开了
Each pair fills one line of the handler, and its default steps aside.

155
00:08:48,350 --> 00:08:51,870
录制记录显示 Bonjour à tous，替身也一样
The recording shows Bonjour à tous, and so does the stand-in.

156
00:08:52,190 --> 00:08:57,587
第 4 步：试试希腊语、印地语，或者用 zh-cn 试简体中文
Step 4: try Greek, Hindi, or zh-cn for simplified Chinese.

157
00:08:57,907 --> 00:08:59,507
暂停一下，多试几个
Pause and try a few.

158
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:04,510
检查点：一个 endpoint，不同的输入，不用重新部署
The checkpoint: one endpoint, different inputs, no redeploy;

159
00:09:04,510 --> 00:09:08,208
而且 source 和 destination 是语言，不是区域
and source and destination are languages, not regions.

160
00:09:08,483 --> 00:09:11,235
第 5 步：打开 Observability 下的 Logs
Step 5: open Observability, Logs.

161
00:09:11,555 --> 00:09:15,118
录制记录里找到了那条法语请求，状态码 200
The recording found its French request with status 200.

162
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:21,150
我们录制时，服务方超时过一次：客户端收到状态码 500
While we recorded, the provider timed out once: the client got status 500,

163
00:09:21,150 --> 00:09:26,211
服务器日志里有这次超时，是从 main.py 第 12 行抛出的
and the server log showed the timeout, raised from line 12 of main.py.

164
00:09:26,531 --> 00:09:28,386
过了一会儿重试就成功了
A retry soon after worked.

165
00:09:28,633 --> 00:09:29,811
README 提醒
The README warns:

166
00:09:29,811 --> 00:09:33,969
googletrans 这个库包装的是一个非官方的外部服务
the googletrans library wraps an unofficial outside service,

167
00:09:33,969 --> 00:09:36,740
所以要看日志，别只看构建成功没有
so check the logs, not a finished build.

168
00:09:36,983 --> 00:09:38,903
再看 gcloud 替代做法
Now the gcloud alternative.

169
00:09:39,223 --> 00:09:45,730
在新项目里，它可能先要你启用 API 或创建一个仓库；都选是
In a new project it may first ask to enable APIs or create a repository; answer yes.

170
00:09:46,050 --> 00:09:50,339
用占位符时，部署停在项目 ID 检查
With the placeholder, the deploy stops at the project ID check;

171
00:09:50,339 --> 00:09:53,879
换成格式正确的 ID，它会先要你登录
with a real-format ID, it asks you to sign in first.

172
00:09:54,283 --> 00:09:56,278
下一行把 URL 存起来
The next line stores the URL;

173
00:09:56,278 --> 00:10:01,643
这几行 curl 原样对着替身跑，回答的也是 Bonjour à tous
the curl lines ran unchanged against the stand-in and answered Bonjour à tous.

174
00:10:02,516 --> 00:10:04,812
README 的 More detail 框里说
From the README's More detail box:

175
00:10:04,812 --> 00:10:09,876
冷启动启动的是你应用的一个实例，不一定是一台新机器
a cold start starts an instance of your app, not necessarily a new machine.

176
00:10:10,196 --> 00:10:12,372
没有哪个固定的空闲时长能预测它
No fixed idle time predicts it.

177
00:10:13,417 --> 00:10:14,604
第 2 部分
Part 2.

178
00:10:14,654 --> 00:10:18,857
现在想象一个容器化的 web 应用，已经在你的笔记本上跑通了
Now imagine a containerized web app already working on your laptop.

179
00:10:19,177 --> 00:10:21,243
分享 localhost 等于什么都没分享
Sharing localhost shares nothing,

180
00:10:21,243 --> 00:10:23,060
所以我们把同一个 image 部署上去
so we deploy that same image.

181
00:10:23,300 --> 00:10:27,805
第 1 步，先把 Docker 跑起来：docker run，用完就删
Step 1, with Docker running: docker run, remove when done,

182
00:10:27,805 --> 00:10:32,388
把 port 8086 发布到 8080，再加上教程的公开 image
publish port 8086 to 8080, and the tutorial's public image.

183
00:10:32,708 --> 00:10:34,050
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

184
00:10:34,100 --> 00:10:38,324
这个 digest 和 README 里的一样：同样的字节，同样的 digest
The digest equals the README's: same bytes, same digest.

185
00:10:38,644 --> 00:10:43,033
这个 image 是为 amd64 构建的，Cloud Run 需要的就是它
The image is built for amd64, which Cloud Run needs;

186
00:10:43,033 --> 00:10:46,495
在 Apple Silicon 上它会模拟运行
on Apple Silicon it runs under emulation.

187
00:10:46,734 --> 00:10:52,601
然后 gunicorn 监听 0.0.0.0 的 port 8080
Then gunicorn listens on 0.0.0.0, port 8080.

188
00:10:52,921 --> 00:10:57,870
这就是所有网络接口，这样 container 外面来的连接才能到它
That is every network interface, so connections from outside the container reach it.

189
00:10:58,117 --> 00:11:00,592
Python 是怎么变成 gunicorn 的？
How did Python turn into gunicorn?

190
00:11:00,912 --> 00:11:03,704
首先，这个 image 有两个启动位置
First, the image has two start-up slots:

191
00:11:03,704 --> 00:11:07,824
一个空的 entrypoint，和一个命令，translation demo serve
an empty entrypoint, and a command, translation_demo serve.

192
00:11:08,144 --> 00:11:14,432
Docker 先运行 entrypoint，再运行命令，你传的参数会替换命令
Docker runs the entrypoint, then the command, and arguments you pass replace the command;

193
00:11:14,432 --> 00:11:16,058
第 4 部分就靠这一点
part 4 depends on this.

194
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:19,257
这个命令从 PORT 变量里取 port
That command takes its port from the PORT

195
00:11:19,257 --> 00:11:23,874
然后把自己替换成 gunicorn：1 个 worker，4 个线程
variable and replaces itself with gunicorn: 1 worker, 4 threads.

196
00:11:24,117 --> 00:11:25,717
额外检查也对得上
Extra checks agree.

197
00:11:25,824 --> 00:11:28,245
命令 docker top 只显示 gunicorn
docker top shows only gunicorn,

198
00:11:28,245 --> 00:11:29,925
一个 master 和一个 worker
a master and a worker;

199
00:11:29,925 --> 00:11:31,525
一个 Python 进程都不剩
no Python is left.

200
00:11:31,690 --> 00:11:34,589
命令 docker ps 显示了这扇门
docker ps shows the door, 8086 outside and 8080 inside, so 8080 on the laptop is refused.

201
00:11:34,589 --> 00:11:40,138
外面是 8086，里面是 8080，所以笔记本上的 8080 会被拒绝
docker ps shows the door, 8086 outside and 8080 inside, so 8080 on the laptop is refused.

202
00:11:40,384 --> 00:11:43,349
第 2 步：打开 localhost 8086
Step 2: open localhost 8086.

203
00:11:43,669 --> 00:11:44,754
额外跑一下 curl
An extra curl

204
00:11:44,754 --> 00:11:47,932
可以看到 gunicorn 返回的状态码 200、页面标题
shows status 200 from gunicorn, the title,

205
00:11:47,932 --> 00:11:50,645
还有被禁用的 Play audio 按钮
and the disabled Play audio button.

206
00:11:50,884 --> 00:11:52,484
第 3 步：翻译
Step 3: translate.

207
00:11:52,761 --> 00:11:55,621
这个按钮用一个 POST 请求发送 JSON
The button sends JSON in a post request and gets back Bonjour à tous, once the browser decodes that escape.

208
00:11:55,621 --> 00:11:59,780
拿回 Bonjour à tous，不过要等浏览器把那个转义解码
The button sends JSON in a post request and gets back Bonjour à tous, once the browser decodes that escape.

209
00:12:00,100 --> 00:12:01,484
暂停一下，试一试
Pause and try it.

210
00:12:01,534 --> 00:12:06,260
第 1 部分的查询字符串在这里得到 405，方法不允许
The query string from part 1 gets 405 here, method not allowed:

211
00:12:06,260 --> 00:12:08,211
这个应用要的是 JSON 的 POST 请求
this app wants JSON posts.

212
00:12:08,531 --> 00:12:10,686
编造一种语言，得到的是 400
A made-up language gets 400.

213
00:12:10,934 --> 00:12:17,142
第 4 步：Play audio 是禁用的，它的请求得到 503：语音已关闭
Step 4: Play audio is disabled, and its request gets 503: speech is disabled.

214
00:12:17,462 --> 00:12:22,987
用 Ctrl-C 停掉；gunicorn 是主进程，所以它会干净地退出
Stop with Ctrl+C; gunicorn is the main process, so it shuts down cleanly.

215
00:12:23,234 --> 00:12:26,416
再做一个额外实验：把 PORT 设成 9090
One extra experiment: set PORT to 9090

216
00:12:26,416 --> 00:12:30,855
但管道还接在 8080，连接就被重置了
but keep the pipe at 8080, and the connection resets;

217
00:12:30,855 --> 00:12:33,452
日志显示 gunicorn 在 9090 上
the log shows gunicorn on 9090.

218
00:12:33,867 --> 00:12:36,662
改成把管道接到 9090，它就回答了
Pipe to 9090 instead, and it answers.

219
00:12:36,982 --> 00:12:39,840
右边那个数字必须是应用监听的地方
The right-hand number must be where the app listens.

220
00:12:44,433 --> 00:12:47,434
课上讲的 Cloud Run 跑的是整个 container
The lecture's Cloud Run runs a whole container,

221
00:12:47,434 --> 00:12:49,034
作为 service 或者 job
as a service or a job.

222
00:12:49,254 --> 00:12:53,948
它的步骤：打开 Cloud Run、启用 API、部署一个 image
Its steps: open Cloud Run, enable the APIs, deploy an image.

223
00:12:54,183 --> 00:12:57,394
打开 Cloud Run 里 Services 下的 Deploy container，选择
Open Cloud Run, Services, Deploy container,

224
00:12:57,394 --> 00:13:01,799
Deploy one revision from an existing container image
and choose Deploy one revision from an existing container image.

225
00:13:02,119 --> 00:13:06,322
粘贴同一个 image，命名为 translation-demo，再选你的区域
Paste the same image, name it translation-demo, and choose your region.

226
00:13:07,416 --> 00:13:10,787
选 Allow public access 和 Request-based billing
Select Allow public access and Request-based billing.

227
00:13:11,107 --> 00:13:14,883
扩缩设置里，最小实例数 0，最大实例数 2
Under scaling, minimum 0 instances and maximum 2.

228
00:13:15,133 --> 00:13:17,437
在 container 设置里
In the container settings:

229
00:13:17,437 --> 00:13:22,223
port 8080，512 MiB，1 个 CPU，命令不动
port 8080, 512 MiB, 1 CPU, and the command left alone;

230
00:13:22,223 --> 00:13:25,501
Cloud Run 会设置 PORT，再去敲这扇门
Cloud Run sets PORT and knocks on it.

231
00:13:25,821 --> 00:13:30,941
然后是 120 秒的超时，每个实例 4 个并发请求
Then a 120 second timeout and 4 concurrent requests per instance.

232
00:13:31,183 --> 00:13:35,282
为什么是 4？每个实例跑的 gunicorn 有 4 个线程
Why 4? Each instance runs gunicorn with 4 threads,

233
00:13:35,282 --> 00:13:37,924
所以它收到的请求永远不会超过它能处理的
so it never gets more than it can serve.

234
00:13:38,166 --> 00:13:44,054
按请求计费、最小实例数为 0 时，计价器只在处理请求的时候走
With request-based billing and a minimum of 0, the meter moves only while requests are served.

235
00:13:44,374 --> 00:13:48,001
这就是课上的承诺：只在代码运行时付钱
That is the lecture's promise: pay only when your code runs.

236
00:13:48,321 --> 00:13:52,737
最小实例数设成 1，或者按实例计费，空闲时间也会计费
A minimum of 1, or instance-based billing, bills idle time too.

237
00:13:53,433 --> 00:13:56,270
并发数 4，最大实例数 2
Concurrency 4, maximum 2 instances.

238
00:13:56,590 --> 00:13:58,724
十个人同时点 Translate
Ten people press Translate at once.

239
00:13:59,044 --> 00:14:02,500
会启动几个实例，最后两个会怎样？
How many instances start, and what happens to the last two?

240
00:14:11,350 --> 00:14:14,081
两个实例，到上限了，一共 8 个空位
Two instances, the ceiling, with 8 slots.

241
00:14:14,401 --> 00:14:17,750
另外两个要等空位，还可能被拒绝
The other two wait for a free slot and can be refused.

242
00:14:18,070 --> 00:14:22,221
调高最大实例数，或者把并发数和线程数一起调高
Raise the maximum, or raise concurrency together with the threads;

243
00:14:22,221 --> 00:14:25,289
调高最小实例数没用。点 Create
a higher minimum doesn't help. Select Create;

244
00:14:25,289 --> 00:14:30,921
录制记录显示公开页面回答 Bonjour à tous，语音还是关着的
the recording shows the public page answering Bonjour à tous, speech still disabled.

245
00:14:31,241 --> 00:14:33,523
然后看 Revision History 和 Logs
Then check Revision History and Logs.

246
00:14:33,843 --> 00:14:37,747
一个 revision，就是 image 加上它的设置部署出去的一个版本
A revision is a deployed version of the image and its settings.

247
00:14:38,067 --> 00:14:39,667
暂停一下，部署你自己的
Pause and deploy yours.

248
00:14:39,850 --> 00:14:41,514
这次什么都没构建
Nothing was built this time.

249
00:14:44,050 --> 00:14:46,714
控制台拿到的是一个 tag，一个可以移动的标签
The console took a tag, a movable label;

250
00:14:46,714 --> 00:14:50,109
revision 记住的是 digest，一个固定的指纹
the revision keeps the digest, a fixed fingerprint.

251
00:14:50,429 --> 00:14:53,799
以后要复现一次部署，就按 digest 部署
To reproduce a deployment later, deploy by digest.

252
00:14:54,033 --> 00:14:58,065
用 gcloud 的替代做法，一条命令就设好同样的值
The gcloud alternative sets the same values in one command.

253
00:15:01,033 --> 00:15:04,724
上半场完成：你笔记本上的页面有了公网 URL
First half done: your laptop's page at a public URL.

254
00:15:05,044 --> 00:15:06,951
但 Play audio 还在等
But Play audio still waits:

255
00:15:06,951 --> 00:15:12,468
要说话，应用得调用一个会问调用方是谁的 API。那是谁？
to speak, the app must call an API that asks who is calling. Who is it?

256
00:15:13,517 --> 00:15:18,715
第 3 部分。README 把两个问题分开：谁可以调用我们的公开应用
Part 3. The README separates two questions: who may call our public app,

257
00:15:18,715 --> 00:15:20,920
以及运行中的应用可以访问什么
and what the running app may access.

258
00:15:21,167 --> 00:15:25,211
第一扇门，谁可以调用它，就是 Allow public access
The first door, who may call it, is Allow public access;

259
00:15:25,211 --> 00:15:28,100
gcloud 里写成 --no-invoker-iam-check
gcloud spells it --no-invoker-iam-check.

260
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:33,156
如果组织政策禁止它，这个 URL 就返回 403
If an organization policy forbids it, the URL answers 403.

261
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:35,700
那么，快速测一下
So, a quick test.

262
00:15:35,764 --> 00:15:37,940
这个 service 允许公开访问
The service allows public access.

263
00:15:38,260 --> 00:15:40,415
那它能因此调用 Agent Platform 吗？
Does that let it call Agent Platform?

264
00:15:47,250 --> 00:15:50,151
不能。那扇门只放调用方进来
No. That door only admits callers.

265
00:15:50,471 --> 00:15:55,741
往外调用走的是另一扇门，用的是这个 service 运行时的身份
Calling out goes through the other door, as whatever identity the service runs as;

266
00:15:55,741 --> 00:16:00,690
在你挂上一个之前，一般就是项目的默认计算账号
until you attach one, that is normally the project's default compute account.

267
00:16:00,934 --> 00:16:05,554
第 1 步：在 API Library 里启用 Agent Platform API
Step 1: in the API Library, enable the Agent Platform API,

268
00:16:05,554 --> 00:16:11,131
这是控制台现在对前几讲所说的 Vertex AI 的叫法
the console's current name for what earlier lectures called Vertex AI.

269
00:16:11,367 --> 00:16:12,565
第 2 和第 3 步
Steps 2 and 3:

270
00:16:12,565 --> 00:16:16,628
建一个服务账号，名字叫 Translation demo runtime
create a service account named Translation demo runtime,

271
00:16:16,628 --> 00:16:19,410
ID 是 translation-demo-runtime
with the ID translation-demo-runtime.

272
00:16:19,767 --> 00:16:21,367
第 4 步：两个角色
Step 4: two roles.

273
00:16:21,623 --> 00:16:24,567
Agent Platform User 让它可以调用模型
Agent Platform User lets it call the model.

274
00:16:24,887 --> 00:16:29,118
Service Usage Consumer 让它可以把调用记到一个配额项目上
Service Usage Consumer lets it charge calls to a quota project:

275
00:16:29,118 --> 00:16:32,610
也就是这些调用占用哪个项目的配额、记到哪个项目的账单上
the project whose quota and bill they count against.

276
00:16:32,930 --> 00:16:34,807
应用在那里填的是你的项目
The app names your project there.

277
00:16:35,127 --> 00:16:38,327
两个主账号字段都留空，点 Done
Leave both principal fields empty and select Done.

278
00:16:38,567 --> 00:16:40,786
第 5 步：记下这个账号的邮箱
Step 5: note the account's email.

279
00:16:41,106 --> 00:16:43,389
不用创建也不用下载密钥
No key to create or download:

280
00:16:43,389 --> 00:16:47,169
第 3 讲里有一个 JSON 密钥放在 secrets 目录里
in lecture 3 a JSON key sat in a secrets folder;

281
00:16:47,169 --> 00:16:48,769
这里根本没有
here none exists.

282
00:16:48,828 --> 00:16:53,948
录制记录显示账号已启用，没有密钥；暂停一下，建一个你自己的
The recording shows the account enabled, with no keys; pause and create yours.

283
00:16:54,184 --> 00:17:00,259
用 gcloud 的替代做法，会启用 API、创建账号、加上两个角色
The gcloud alternative enables the API, creates the account, and adds the two roles;

284
00:17:00,259 --> 00:17:03,080
两条绑定都在整个项目上
both bindings are on the whole project.

285
00:17:04,117 --> 00:17:07,059
挂上这个账号，需要你自己的一项权限
Attaching the account takes a permission of yours:

286
00:17:07,059 --> 00:17:09,237
这个账号上的 Service Account User
Service Account User on that account.

287
00:17:09,557 --> 00:17:13,376
这是你的部署权限，和这个账号自己的角色是两回事
That is your deployment right, separate from the account's own roles.

288
00:17:13,617 --> 00:17:16,862
第 1 步：打开 translation-demo。第 2 步
Step 1: open translation-demo. Step 2:

289
00:17:16,862 --> 00:17:21,361
在 Security 标签页里选你的运行时账号，核对它的邮箱
on the Security tab, choose your runtime account, and check its email.

290
00:17:22,684 --> 00:17:27,103
有一个小疏漏：README 在 3.3 节里说会给这个权限
A small gap: the README promises this access in section 3.3,

291
00:17:27,103 --> 00:17:30,492
但那一节给的是 Token Creator
but that section grants Token Creator instead.

292
00:17:30,812 --> 00:17:35,718
项目所有者本来就有；在受限的项目里，去问课程组
Project owners already have it; in a restricted project, ask course staff.

293
00:17:35,967 --> 00:17:38,506
第 3 步：三个环境变量
Step 3: three environment variables.

294
00:17:38,826 --> 00:17:40,391
ENABLE SPEECH 设成 true
ENABLE_SPEECH, true;

295
00:17:40,391 --> 00:17:43,366
GOOGLE CLOUD PROJECT 设成你的项目 ID
GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT, your project ID;

296
00:17:43,366 --> 00:17:46,420
GOOGLE CLOUD LOCATION 设成 us-central1
and GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION, us-central1.

297
00:17:46,740 --> 00:17:48,741
这个 service 跑在多伦多
The service runs in Toronto,

298
00:17:48,741 --> 00:17:52,244
模型在 us-central1：两个不同的设置
the model in us-central1: two different settings.

299
00:17:52,484 --> 00:17:54,583
第 4 步：点 View diff & redeploy
Step 4: View diff & redeploy,

300
00:17:54,583 --> 00:17:57,479
Serve this revision immediately 保持打开
keep Serve this revision immediately on,

301
00:17:57,479 --> 00:17:59,079
再点 Deploy changes
then Deploy changes.

302
00:17:59,247 --> 00:18:03,748
这会产生一个新的 revision；旧的实例是换掉，不是改掉
That makes a new revision; the old instance is replaced, not edited.

303
00:18:04,068 --> 00:18:06,094
第 5 步：等它上线
Step 5: wait for the rollout.

304
00:18:06,367 --> 00:18:07,967
来看语音这条链路
Here is the speech path.

305
00:18:08,159 --> 00:18:11,564
应用会检查开关，再查长度和语言
The app checks the flag, the size and the language,

306
00:18:11,564 --> 00:18:14,502
然后向 Google 的身份验证库要一个令牌
then asks Google's auth library for a token;

307
00:18:14,502 --> 00:18:16,906
在 Cloud Run 上，由工牌提供
on Cloud Run, the badge supplies it.

308
00:18:17,226 --> 00:18:20,255
这个查找过程就是应用默认凭据
That lookup is Application Default Credentials.

309
00:18:20,575 --> 00:18:24,574
在 us-central1 里，Gemini 语音直接把音频发回来
Gemini speech in us-central1 sends audio straight back;

310
00:18:24,574 --> 00:18:26,174
不经过 bucket
no bucket.

311
00:18:26,534 --> 00:18:30,587
第 6 步：刷新页面，因为它在加载时检查开关
Step 6: reload the page, because it checks the flag when it loads.

312
00:18:30,907 --> 00:18:32,809
然后点 Translate 和 Play audio
Then Translate and Play audio;

313
00:18:32,809 --> 00:18:35,409
录制记录显示法语音频在播放
the recording shows French audio playing.

314
00:18:35,729 --> 00:18:39,120
金色标签：每点一次 Play audio，就是一次付费的模型调用
A gold tag: each Play audio is a paid model call.

315
00:18:39,367 --> 00:18:44,700
第 7 步：如果失败了，先看报错信息和日志，再去改权限
Step 7: if it fails, check the message and the logs before changing permissions.

316
00:18:45,020 --> 00:18:49,415
没有开关，你会得到我们录到的 503：语音已关闭
Without the flag, you get our captured 503: speech is disabled.

317
00:18:49,735 --> 00:18:53,639
缺身份，或者调用被拒，各有各的报错信息
A missing identity or a denied call each has its own message.

318
00:18:53,884 --> 00:18:56,999
这就是控制和调试受限的问题，现在变得可以应付了
That is limited control and debugging, made workable.

319
00:18:57,319 --> 00:19:01,286
用 gcloud 的替代做法，一条命令就做同样的改动
The gcloud alternative makes the same change in one command.

320
00:19:04,217 --> 00:19:09,198
3.3 节是可选的，需要 uv：你要怎么在本地开发
Section 3.3 is optional, and needs uv: how would you develop locally,

321
00:19:09,198 --> 00:19:12,302
又不用每改一次就发布一个 image？
without publishing an image for every edit?

322
00:19:12,622 --> 00:19:18,010
有了应用默认凭据，同一份代码在 Cloud Run 上能找到令牌
Application Default Credentials lets the same code find a token on Cloud Run

323
00:19:18,010 --> 00:19:19,854
在你的笔记本上能找到文件
and a file on your laptop.

324
00:19:20,100 --> 00:19:24,964
为了测试运行时账号真实的权限，你的笔记本会 impersonate 它
To test the runtime account's real permissions, your laptop impersonates it.

325
00:19:25,284 --> 00:19:30,044
你以自己的身份登录，再以这个账号的身份拿到短期令牌
You sign in as yourself and receive short-lived tokens as that account;

326
00:19:30,044 --> 00:19:32,324
从头到尾都不下载私钥
no private key is ever downloaded.

327
00:19:32,567 --> 00:19:34,747
第 1 步：在运行时账号上
Step 1: on the runtime account,

328
00:19:34,747 --> 00:19:38,263
给你自己的用户授予 Service Account Token Creator
grant your own user Service Account Token Creator.

329
00:19:38,583 --> 00:19:42,850
把预选的角色换掉，别留着 Service Account Admin
Replace any preselected role, and don't leave Service Account Admin.

330
00:19:43,170 --> 00:19:47,223
再启用 IAM Service Account Credentials API
Enable the IAM Service Account Credentials API too.

331
00:19:47,467 --> 00:19:52,025
第 2 步开头的三条命令，是在终端里重复第 1 步
Step 2 begins with three commands that repeat step 1 from the terminal;

332
00:19:52,025 --> 00:19:54,272
如果你用的是控制台，就跳过它们
if you used the console, skip them.

333
00:19:54,517 --> 00:19:57,764
然后是两条新命令：一次 application-default login
Then two new ones: an application-default login,

334
00:19:57,764 --> 00:20:01,621
impersonate 运行时账号，再设它的配额项目
impersonating the runtime account, and its quota project.

335
00:20:01,941 --> 00:20:04,494
它和 gcloud auth login 是两回事
It is separate from gcloud auth login,

336
00:20:04,494 --> 00:20:08,661
它的文件留在你的机器上，永远不进 Git，也不进 image
and its file stays on your machine, never in Git or the image.

337
00:20:08,981 --> 00:20:10,359
暂停一下，登录
Pause and sign in;

338
00:20:10,359 --> 00:20:15,018
受限的项目可能还要给你 Service Usage Consumer
a restricted project may also need Service Usage Consumer for you.

339
00:20:15,267 --> 00:20:18,586
第 3 步：进入 tutorial 下的 app 目录
Step 3: change into the tutorial app folder,

340
00:20:18,586 --> 00:20:20,472
运行 uv sync --frozen
and run uv sync --frozen.

341
00:20:20,792 --> 00:20:25,379
它完全照着 lock 文件装了 41 个包
It installs 41 packages exactly as the lock file says.

342
00:20:25,699 --> 00:20:29,368
额外跑一下 uv tree，能看到六个直接依赖
An extra uv tree shows the six direct dependencies.

343
00:20:29,617 --> 00:20:32,499
第 4 步：在跑过 export 的那个终端里
Step 4: in the terminal with your exports,

344
00:20:32,499 --> 00:20:36,617
带上那三个变量、把 PORT 设成 8086 启动应用
start the app with the three variables and PORT set to 8086;

345
00:20:36,617 --> 00:20:38,470
这次 port 由你来设
this time you set the port.

346
00:20:38,790 --> 00:20:40,045
暂停一下，跑起来
Pause, run it,

347
00:20:40,045 --> 00:20:43,630
然后在 localhost 8086 上翻译、点 Play audio
then translate and Play audio at localhost 8086;

348
00:20:43,630 --> 00:20:45,894
有了你的登录，它就会说话
with your sign-in, it speaks.

349
00:20:46,134 --> 00:20:50,486
额外检查：按钮现在写着 Play audio，翻译也正常
Extra checks: the button now says Play audio, and translation works.

350
00:20:50,806 --> 00:20:55,051
语音返回 503：Google 凭据不可用
Speech answers 503: Google credentials are unavailable.

351
00:20:55,371 --> 00:20:58,934
这就是缺了登录，跳过第 2 步你就会看到它
That is the missing sign-in, what you see if you skip step 2.

352
00:20:59,584 --> 00:21:03,146
第 5 步：往上退两级，回到 repo 根目录
Step 5: go back up two levels to the repository root.

353
00:21:04,483 --> 00:21:08,256
第 4 部分。一个 web 请求背后有人在等
Part 4. A web request has a person waiting,

354
00:21:08,256 --> 00:21:12,030
但一份翻译后的有声版本应该拿到输入
but a translated audio edition should take its input,

355
00:21:12,030 --> 00:21:15,448
再翻译、朗读、保存文件，然后退出
translate it, speak it, save the files and exit.

356
00:21:15,768 --> 00:21:17,083
这就是 job
That is a job.

357
00:21:17,133 --> 00:21:21,080
课上说一个 container 可以作为 service 或者 job 来跑
The lecture says a container runs as a service or as a job.

358
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:25,609
同一个 image，两个程序：serve 一直监听，没有尽头
Same image, two programs: serve keeps listening, with no end;

359
00:21:25,609 --> 00:21:27,885
batch 走完四步就退出
batch walks four steps and exits.

360
00:21:29,466 --> 00:21:35,913
这种形状你见过：上周的 Vertex AI 训练任务也是有限的工作
You have seen this shape before: last week's Vertex AI training job was finite work too:

361
00:21:35,913 --> 00:21:37,744
启动、训练、保存、退出
start, train, save, exit.

362
00:21:37,983 --> 00:21:41,994
一个 job 没有 URL，它的磁盘在退出时就没了
A job has no URL, and its disk vanishes when it exits.

363
00:21:42,314 --> 00:21:45,836
所以输入从 Storage 来，结果也回到那里
So input comes from Storage and results go back there;

364
00:21:45,836 --> 00:21:49,226
远程的 container 看不到你笔记本上的文件
a remote container cannot see a file on your laptop.

365
00:21:49,466 --> 00:21:52,239
第 1 步：Cloud Storage、Buckets、Create
Step 1: Cloud Storage, Buckets, Create.

366
00:21:52,559 --> 00:21:54,857
第 2 步：起一个全局唯一的名字
Step 2: a globally unique name,

367
00:21:54,857 --> 00:21:58,341
比如你的项目 ID 加上 translation input
such as your project ID plus translation input.

368
00:21:58,661 --> 00:22:01,523
第 3 步：区域选多伦多，存储类别选 Standard
Step 3: region Toronto, class Standard,

369
00:22:01,523 --> 00:22:03,358
开启禁止公开访问
public access prevention,

370
00:22:03,358 --> 00:22:07,834
统一访问也开启，软删除保持默认，然后点 Create 和 Confirm
uniform access, default soft delete, then Create and Confirm.

371
00:22:08,154 --> 00:22:09,716
暂停一下，建好它
Pause and create it.

372
00:22:09,766 --> 00:22:12,731
第 4 步：再建一个单独的输出 bucket
Step 4: repeat for a separate output bucket.

373
00:22:13,051 --> 00:22:16,012
金色标签：文件存在期间存储就计费
A gold tag: storage bills while files exist,

374
00:22:16,012 --> 00:22:19,174
软删除还会把删掉的文件保留一段时间
and soft delete keeps deleted ones for a while.

375
00:22:19,416 --> 00:22:24,211
第 5 步：在输入 bucket 里建一个叫 run-001 的目录
Step 5: create a folder named run-001 in the input bucket

376
00:22:24,211 --> 00:22:28,248
把示例段落传进去，就是四行短句
and upload the sample passage, four short lines.

377
00:22:28,568 --> 00:22:31,107
第 6 步：复制它的 Storage URI
Step 6: copy its Storage URI.

378
00:22:31,427 --> 00:22:33,902
暂停一下，上传，再复制 URI
Pause, upload and copy the URI.

379
00:22:34,150 --> 00:22:39,121
这个 run-001 是你自己选的前缀，不是真的目录
That run-001 is a prefix you chose, not a real directory.

380
00:22:39,441 --> 00:22:40,946
用 gcloud 的替代做法
The gcloud alternative

381
00:22:40,946 --> 00:22:44,774
一个命令框就建好两个 bucket，再上传段落
makes both buckets and uploads the passage in one block.

382
00:22:48,283 --> 00:22:51,931
4.2 节：这个 job 有自己的身份
Section 4.2: the job gets its own identity.

383
00:22:52,251 --> 00:22:54,188
建 translation-audio-job
Create translation-audio-job,

384
00:22:54,188 --> 00:22:57,862
给它同样的两个项目级角色，记下它的邮箱
give it the same two project roles, and note its email.

385
00:22:58,100 --> 00:23:01,859
然后按 bucket 授权：输入 bucket 给 Storage Object Viewer
Then, per bucket: Storage Object Viewer on the input,

386
00:23:01,859 --> 00:23:04,767
输出 bucket 给 Storage Object Creator
and Storage Object Creator on the output,

387
00:23:04,767 --> 00:23:08,383
它能加文件，但不能列出，也不能覆盖
which adds files but cannot list or overwrite them.

388
00:23:08,703 --> 00:23:10,720
而 web service 的账号两个都不需要
The web account needs neither.

389
00:23:10,770 --> 00:23:15,807
你自己的身份要上传、执行和查看结果，各要单独的权限
Your own identity needs separate rights to upload, execute and see results.

390
00:23:16,127 --> 00:23:18,752
暂停一下，把账号和两条授权都建好
Pause and create the account and both grants.

391
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:23,266
用 gcloud 的替代做法，会创建账号，再加上全部四条授权
The gcloud alternative creates the account and adds all four grants.

392
00:23:26,133 --> 00:23:27,133
4.3 节
Section 4.3:

393
00:23:27,133 --> 00:23:32,170
挂上这个账号，同样要你在它上面有 Service Account User
attaching this account again takes your Service Account User on it.

394
00:23:32,490 --> 00:23:35,517
在 Cloud Run 里 Jobs 下的 Deploy container
In Cloud Run, Jobs, Deploy container opens Create job.

395
00:23:35,517 --> 00:23:37,070
会打开 Create job
In Cloud Run, Jobs, Deploy container opens Create job.

396
00:23:37,120 --> 00:23:40,554
同一个 image，名字叫 translation-audio，1 个 task
The same image, the name translation-audio, 1 task.

397
00:23:40,816 --> 00:23:42,018
Container command
Container command:

398
00:23:42,018 --> 00:23:44,289
输入 python，再按 Enter，生成一个 chip
python, then Enter to make a chip.

399
00:23:44,443 --> 00:23:48,198
它填的是 entrypoint 那个位置，这个 image 把它留空了
It fills the entrypoint slot, which this image left empty.

400
00:23:48,433 --> 00:23:49,738
Container arguments
Container arguments:

401
00:23:49,738 --> 00:23:55,089
11 个值，每个值一个 chip，合在一起占掉命令那个位置
eleven values, each its own chip, and together they take the command slot's place.

402
00:23:55,409 --> 00:24:00,166
-m、translation demo、batch、input URI 和你的段落
-m, translation_demo, batch, input URI and your passage,

403
00:24:00,166 --> 00:24:04,753
source en、destination fr，output URI 和你的前缀
source en, destination fr, output URI and your prefix.

404
00:24:05,073 --> 00:24:07,740
每个 chip 就是参数列表里的一项
Each chip is one item of the argument list.

405
00:24:07,983 --> 00:24:13,128
然后是同样的三个变量、5 分钟的 task 超时、0 次重试
Then the same three variables, a task timeout of 5 minutes, and 0 retries,

406
00:24:13,128 --> 00:24:15,492
因为一次重试会重复付费的工作
because a retry repeats paid work.

407
00:24:15,812 --> 00:24:19,140
在 Security 里，按邮箱选 job 的账号
On Security, choose the job's account by its email.

408
00:24:19,460 --> 00:24:23,321
Execute job immediately 不要勾选，然后点 Create
Leave Execute job immediately unchecked, then select Create;

409
00:24:23,321 --> 00:24:24,900
暂停一下，把它建好
pause and build it.

410
00:24:24,950 --> 00:24:26,907
把 11 个值全贴进一个 chip
Paste all eleven into one chip,

411
00:24:26,907 --> 00:24:31,137
Python 就会去找一个以这一整句为名字的模块
and Python looks for a module with that whole sentence as its name.

412
00:24:31,457 --> 00:24:33,355
名字在第一个点那里被截断
The name is cut at the first dot.

413
00:24:35,166 --> 00:24:36,766
再看另一种错误
Now the other mistake.

414
00:24:36,958 --> 00:24:41,459
你把 11 个参数 chip 都填了，却把 Container command 留空
You fill all eleven argument chips but leave Container command empty.

415
00:24:41,779 --> 00:24:43,636
这个 container 会试着运行什么？
What does the container try to run?

416
00:24:52,483 --> 00:24:57,134
参数替换了默认命令，又没有 entrypoint
The arguments replace the default command, and with no entrypoint,

417
00:24:57,134 --> 00:24:58,755
-m 就成了要运行的程序
-m becomes the program.

418
00:24:59,075 --> 00:25:02,339
在 Docker 里复现的版本失败了：找不到可执行文件
Docker's version fails: executable not found.

419
00:25:03,483 --> 00:25:07,400
如果什么都不改，这个 job 会启动 web 服务器
With nothing changed, the job starts the web server and waits

420
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:10,160
一直等到 5 分钟后超时把它判为失败
until the timeout fails it after 5 minutes.

421
00:25:10,400 --> 00:25:14,156
用 gcloud 的替代做法，传的是同样的 11 个值
The gcloud alternative passes the same eleven values,

422
00:25:14,156 --> 00:25:16,778
用逗号隔开，命令用 python
comma separated, with command python.

423
00:25:18,200 --> 00:25:22,403
4.4 节：打开这个 job，点 Execute
Section 4.4: open the job and select Execute.

424
00:25:22,723 --> 00:25:26,371
录制记录显示它成功了，History 里有一个绿勾
The recording shows it succeeding, with a green check in History.

425
00:25:26,917 --> 00:25:28,517
红色标记意味着什么？
What would a red mark mean?

426
00:25:28,752 --> 00:25:33,199
我们在笔记本上额外跑了一次，不开语音开关，它以退出码 1 退出
Our extra laptop run without the speech flag exits with status 1,

427
00:25:33,199 --> 00:25:36,346
这是一次如实的失败，所以 History 说的是真话
an honest failure, so History tells the truth.

428
00:25:37,300 --> 00:25:40,863
第 2 步：打开这次执行，再点 Tasks 里的 View logs
Step 2: open the execution, then Tasks, View logs.

429
00:25:41,183 --> 00:25:43,999
这个 job 会退出；它没有 web URL
The job exits; it has no web URL.

430
00:25:44,319 --> 00:25:46,691
它最后的输出是一段 JSON 摘要
Its last output is a JSON summary

431
00:25:46,691 --> 00:25:50,525
里面有输出和 manifest 的位置、状态 complete
with the output and manifest locations, status complete,

432
00:25:50,525 --> 00:25:51,917
还有那几个文件
and the files.

433
00:25:51,967 --> 00:25:56,127
第 3 步：打开你的输出 bucket，再打开 run-001
Step 3: open your output bucket, then run-001.

434
00:25:56,447 --> 00:25:58,964
里面是一个名字随机的目录
Inside is a folder with a random name.

435
00:25:59,284 --> 00:26:01,366
第 4 步：三个文件
Step 4: three files:

436
00:26:01,366 --> 00:26:06,153
translated.txt、speech.wav 和 manifest.json
translated.txt, speech.wav, and manifest.json.

437
00:26:06,400 --> 00:26:07,822
顺序很重要
The order matters.

438
00:26:07,872 --> 00:26:09,659
每次上传都是只创建、不覆盖
Each upload is create-only,

439
00:26:09,659 --> 00:26:13,035
而写着 complete 的 manifest 最后才写
and the manifest, saying complete, is written last.

440
00:26:13,355 --> 00:26:14,733
它就是回执
It is the receipt.

441
00:26:14,783 --> 00:26:16,575
那么，第三个要看的地方
So, the third place to look.

442
00:26:16,895 --> 00:26:22,463
绿勾说明进程以 0 退出；manifest 说明工作完成了
A green check says the process exited with 0; the manifest says the work is complete.

443
00:26:22,783 --> 00:26:25,279
没有 manifest 的文件什么都证明不了
Files without a manifest prove nothing.

444
00:26:25,517 --> 00:26:28,824
同一个 job 再执行一次，参数不变
Execute the same job again, with the same arguments.

445
00:26:29,144 --> 00:26:31,042
第一次的结果会被覆盖吗？
Is the first result overwritten?

446
00:26:37,883 --> 00:26:41,745
不会。一个新的 attempt 目录出现在第一个旁边
No. A new attempt folder lands beside the first,

447
00:26:41,745 --> 00:26:44,390
只创建的上传也不能覆盖
and create-only uploads cannot overwrite.

448
00:26:44,710 --> 00:26:50,641
但这不是恰好一次：一次重试会重复付费的工作，所以重试设成 0
But it is not exactly once: a retry repeats paid work, which is why retries are 0.

449
00:26:50,883 --> 00:26:54,680
第 5 步：用下载图标下载文本和音频
Step 5: download the text and the audio with the icons.

450
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:56,600
暂停一下，跑你的 job
Pause and run your job.

451
00:26:56,856 --> 00:27:01,742
金色标签：每次执行按运行时间计费，再加一次语音调用
A gold tag: each execution bills its running time plus one speech call.

452
00:27:01,983 --> 00:27:04,849
用 gcloud 的替代做法，会带 --wait 执行
The gcloud alternative executes with --wait,

453
00:27:04,849 --> 00:27:08,170
建一个 results 目录，再把输出拷下来
makes a results folder, and copies the output down.

454
00:27:08,490 --> 00:27:10,901
这个 --wait 参数不会实时显示你应用的日志
The --wait flag does not stream your app's logs.

455
00:27:11,150 --> 00:27:15,189
README 的检查点：task 完成了，进程停了
The README's checkpoint: the task finished, the process stopped,

456
00:27:15,189 --> 00:27:17,209
它的文件留在 Storage 里
and its files remain in Storage.

457
00:27:18,250 --> 00:27:21,471
4.5 节：从终端提交新的工作
Section 4.5: new work from the terminal.

458
00:27:21,791 --> 00:27:23,726
先说你自己的一项权限
First, a permission of yours:

459
00:27:23,726 --> 00:27:29,599
带覆盖参数运行 job 需要单独的权限，和 job 账号的角色无关
running a job with overrides needs its own right, separate from the job account's roles.

460
00:27:29,833 --> 00:27:31,540
到现在只用了控制台？
Console only so far?

461
00:27:31,860 --> 00:27:33,694
先把终端设置跑一遍
Run the terminal setup first.

462
00:27:34,014 --> 00:27:37,705
存一段短文，不超过 5000 个字符
Save a short passage, under 5,000 characters,

463
00:27:37,705 --> 00:27:42,462
作为 repo 根目录下的 passage.txt，或者直接复制示例
as passage.txt in the repository root, or copy the sample.

464
00:27:42,782 --> 00:27:46,902
把两个 bucket 名字 export 出来，再把它上传到 run-002 下
Export both bucket names and upload it under run-002;

465
00:27:46,902 --> 00:27:49,545
它又会停在占位符那里
it stops at the placeholder again.

466
00:27:49,783 --> 00:27:53,090
第 3 步：带覆盖参数执行已有的 job
Step 3: execute the existing job with overrides.

467
00:27:53,410 --> 00:27:57,286
它们会替换整个参数列表，只对这次执行有效
They replace the whole argument list for this execution only:

468
00:27:57,286 --> 00:27:58,886
一个新路径，再加上西班牙语
a new path and Spanish.

469
00:27:59,106 --> 00:28:03,778
保存的 job 里还是法语，而且你漏掉的参数不会从它那里补上
The saved job still says French, and a flag you leave out is not taken from it.

470
00:28:05,050 --> 00:28:11,045
第 4 步：成功之后，建好 results 目录，把 run-002 拷下来
Step 4: after it succeeds, make the results folder and copy run-002 down.

471
00:28:11,365 --> 00:28:15,098
README 的录制记录显示一次成功的西班牙语执行
The README's recording shows a successful Spanish execution.

472
00:28:15,333 --> 00:28:18,832
4.6 节：helper 脚本把这三步合在一起
Section 4.6: the helper combines all three.

473
00:28:19,152 --> 00:28:21,370
额外跑一次 dry run，能看到它的计划
An extra dry run shows its plan.

474
00:28:21,690 --> 00:28:26,267
它上传到一个新的 run 目录，用时间加一段随机字符命名
It uploads to a fresh run folder named by the time and a random part,

475
00:28:26,267 --> 00:28:29,584
再带着 11 个参数执行，然后下载
executes with the eleven arguments, and downloads.

476
00:28:29,833 --> 00:28:34,242
真跑的时候，它会在运行每条 gcloud 命令之前先打印出来
Run for real, it prints each gcloud command before running it and stops

477
00:28:34,242 --> 00:28:35,842
遇到第一个失败就停
at the first failure.

478
00:28:36,062 --> 00:28:37,983
暂停一下，用你的名字跑一遍
Pause and run it with your names.

479
00:28:39,950 --> 00:28:43,790
第 2 步：打开结果目录，播放 speech.wav
Step 2: open the result folder and play speech.wav.

480
00:28:44,110 --> 00:28:47,530
这个 helper 脚本只有在找到完整的 manifest 之后
The helper prints Downloaded results only after it finds a complete manifest: the receipt again.

481
00:28:47,530 --> 00:28:50,339
才会打印 Downloaded results：又是回执
The helper prints Downloaded results only after it finds a complete manifest: the receipt again.

482
00:28:53,583 --> 00:28:57,987
收尾清理。第 1 步：把想留的东西下载下来。第 2 步
Clean up. Step 1: download what you want to keep. Step 2:

483
00:28:57,987 --> 00:29:02,159
删掉 translate-function 和 translation-demo，再删 job
delete translate-function and translation-demo, then the job.

484
00:29:02,516 --> 00:29:06,176
第 3 步：删掉你的 bucket 和两个运行时账号
Step 3: delete your buckets and the two runtime accounts

485
00:29:06,176 --> 00:29:07,776
前提是已经没有东西在用它们
once nothing uses them.

486
00:29:07,999 --> 00:29:12,148
第 4 步：Artifact Registry 里那个函数的 image
Step 4: the function's image in Artifact Registry, still there

487
00:29:12,148 --> 00:29:13,887
service 删了它还在
after the service is gone.

488
00:29:14,207 --> 00:29:16,020
暂停一下，现在全部删掉
Pause and delete them all now.

489
00:29:16,266 --> 00:29:17,624
补充两点
Two additions.

490
00:29:17,674 --> 00:29:23,690
软删除的文件还会计费一段时间；构建还会留下源代码归档和日志
Soft-deleted files stay billable for a while; the build also leaves source archives and logs.

491
00:29:24,010 --> 00:29:27,786
还有，README 也说了，留着那个共享的公开 image；别人也在用
And, per the README, keep the shared public image; others use it.

492
00:29:29,233 --> 00:29:30,634
卡在哪一步了？
Stuck on a step?

493
00:29:30,684 --> 00:29:34,630
README 最后有一张故障排查表，列出症状和检查方法
The README ends with a troubleshooting table of symptoms and checks.

494
00:29:37,566 --> 00:29:39,159
来看整张地图
Here is the whole map.

495
00:29:39,209 --> 00:29:42,942
第 1 部分交出的是一个文件，image 由 Cloud Build 来做
Part 1 handed over a file, and Cloud Build made the image.

496
00:29:43,262 --> 00:29:45,781
第 2 到第 4 部分交出的是一个 image
Parts 2 to 4 handed over one image:

497
00:29:45,781 --> 00:29:50,601
一个能缩容到零的 service，和一个带着回执退出的 job
a service that scales to zero, and a job that exits with a receipt.

498
00:29:50,850 --> 00:29:53,943
现在看课上说的三个缺点，和我们的回答
Now the lecture's three downsides, and our answers.

499
00:29:54,263 --> 00:29:58,423
冷启动：最小实例数设成 1，能让一个实例一直热着，但要花钱
Cold starts: a minimum of 1 keeps an instance warm, for money.

500
00:29:58,666 --> 00:30:04,420
控制和调试受限：有三个地方可看，构建日志、service 日志
Limited control and debugging: three places to look, the build logs, the service logs,

501
00:30:04,420 --> 00:30:07,755
以及 job 的日志和 manifest。厂商锁定
and the job's logs and manifest. Vendor lock-in:

502
00:30:07,755 --> 00:30:11,385
image 和 Functions Framework 都在你的笔记本上跑过
the image and the Functions Framework ran on your laptop;

503
00:30:11,385 --> 00:30:15,269
只有控制台、权限和构建才是 Google 的
only the console, the permissions and the build are Google's.

504
00:30:15,516 --> 00:30:19,380
下一讲：给训练好的模型建一个 Vertex AI endpoint
Next lecture: a Vertex AI endpoint for a trained model,

505
00:30:19,380 --> 00:30:20,833
然后是 pipeline
then pipelines.

506
00:30:20,883 --> 00:30:22,824
自测一下，每道题都暂停想一想
Test yourself, pausing on each.

507
00:30:23,144 --> 00:30:25,982
第一题：把第 1 和第 2 部分放到课上的地图上
One: place parts 1 and 2 on the lecture's map.

508
00:30:26,302 --> 00:30:28,862
你交出的是什么，image 又是谁构建的？
What do you hand over, and who builds the image?

509
00:30:29,100 --> 00:30:33,405
第二题：哪两个设置会让计价器在没人用的时候也走
Two: which two settings make the meter run while nobody uses the app,

510
00:30:33,405 --> 00:30:35,713
最小实例又能买到什么？
and what does a minimum instance buy?

511
00:30:35,950 --> 00:30:38,446
第三题：谁可以调用它，它又以谁的身份运行
Three: who may call it, and who it runs as.

512
00:30:38,766 --> 00:30:42,307
各由哪个设置回答，为什么不需要密钥文件？
Which setting answers each, and why is no key file needed?

513
00:30:42,550 --> 00:30:46,794
第四题：为什么这个 job 要设一个命令和 11 个独立的参数
Four: why does the job set a command and eleven separate arguments,

514
00:30:46,794 --> 00:30:48,694
两个都不设会怎样？
and what happens with neither?

515
00:30:48,933 --> 00:30:52,211
第五题：说出课上讲的 serverless 的三个缺点
Five: name the lecture's three downsides of serverless,

516
00:30:52,211 --> 00:30:54,714
以及这个教程针对每一个给了你什么
and what this tutorial gives you for each.
